{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two friends, one conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/extras/213a1987040bd880dd571a0f6f5bddff.webp?t=1764793555\" width=41 height=52 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/extras/8e27f4e9e3eaead07511a289c2a45b93.webp?t=1764793555\" width=41 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proelium's emperor is on his way to retirement. To heir a new emperor, one master from each district of Proelium must fight until only one remain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as master Letha, a paladin and her mage companion Yoni as they explore the world of Proelium in search of other masters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find and defeat them, or die trying? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES\u200b </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world to explore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story orientated adventure </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mainquests, sidequests and activities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons and bosses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and scrolling </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options to customize the game experience to your liking, including various weapon types and the ability to turn on and off random encounters based on your preference </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute main characters in anime style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple skill trees you can switch between </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events that makes playthroughs a bit different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ hours of playtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/extras/b26e77dcce6a34b5bf10ae21a301f0bb.avif?t=1764793555\" width=800 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can you expect in the remaster?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original Trials of Proelium was my first published game and I've come a long way since then. I wanted to return to my roots and improve my game years later. The list of improvements became so big I felt a full remaster was justified. For the remaster, you can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved art and visuals, including UI design, text font and character portraits </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A better combat system and skill trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events that can make each play-through different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other masters can now be killed or spared, both options having potential consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dialogue improvements and glitch fixes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skin customization options for your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some new mechanics and more content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Brawl Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/75cbf821aa6e74de480f15ec9385a693c4420d7a.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/180c1b835cc467961a77c419fb399ff542bd43e2.jpg"},{"name":"Path of love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/fc04420839e9dad9e96b223c42742eb6ff6ce20d.jpg"},{"name":"Islander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/77769dfba908a82fa5965d5ef4ef9032392e58d0.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks, darlings \u2764","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/12bc9e7eab9fcd7c8024a8822ac550c373b04659.jpg"},{"name":"Well, that happened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/80ff1b3c3d8c8de3409e127bdd6b9742a909810a.jpg"},{"name":"Deathbringer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/020ac1ea281d6ea9695c5d5e8ade91e9d9b8113a.jpg"},{"name":"Merciful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/17ba14dca61ed381b6eeb05b837a0637dfab80ad.jpg"},{"name":"Remastered Empress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/a3b2054ba44b52ca67fa30adea39326d4fd01766.jpg"},{"name":"Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688030/e12396b78853ef14b3f8f15d5c22d961778e7ef6.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688030?t=1764793555","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688030?t=1764793555","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/c3d6c203bb970b4a1802a4dbeb759b35aef8bf76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764793555","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/c3d6c203bb970b4a1802a4dbeb759b35aef8bf76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764793555","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Includes light graphical violence, some swearing, and implied intimacy (but no nudity)"},"demos":[{"appid":3755590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two friends, one conques