b_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/extras/b26e77dcce6a34b5bf10ae21a301f0bb.avif?t=1764793555\" width=800 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can you expect in the remaster?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original Trials of Proelium was my first published game and I've come a long way since then. I wanted to return to my roots and improve my game years later. The list of improvements became so big I felt a full remaster was justified. For the remaster, you can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved art and visuals, including UI design, text font and character portraits </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A better combat system and skill trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events that can make each play-through different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other masters can now be killed or spared, both options having potential consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dialogue improvements and glitch fixes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skin customization options for your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some new mechanics and more content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Retroactive Fort"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/22a587b8b36a6ad9fb7e9bb4ae9d36189b83003f/header.jpg?t=1764793555","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3688030/1960229629/6bfdc8826856fedbf2a3e377b46851eb1229cca7/1750403188/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747222928","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3688030/19602