"26 Jun, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cMost importantly, the world was a lot of fun to explore. The monsters were unique, the regions to explore felt diverse, and the bosses were fun. As flawed and awkward some of the bits of this game may seem at first glance, there is a decent and flavorful fantasy to explore. I recommend anyone play this game once, especially if you enjoy a good RPG.\u201d<br>Churape's dungeon and stuff<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/23f6a6a415e170d7ab72265eea14bfe78b12e98d/ss_23f6a6a415e170d7ab72265eea14bfe78b12e98d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/23f6a6a415e170d7ab72265eea14bfe78b12e98d/ss_23f6a6a415e170d7ab72265eea14bfe78b12e98d.600x338.jpg?t=1764793555"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/020597ea37102431336b9c73056aa88fe1cbf8ad/ss_020597ea37102431336b9c73056aa88fe1cbf8ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/020597ea37102431336b9c73056aa88fe1cbf8ad/ss_020597ea37102431336b9c73056aa88fe1cbf8ad.600x338.jpg?t=1764793555"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/5e7e4a6f3ea52d6beb498b60c8fefa86ac544b04/ss_5e7e4a6f3ea52d6beb498b60c8fefa86ac544b04.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/5e7e4a6f3ea52d6beb498b60c8fefa86ac544b04/ss_5e7e4a6f3ea52d6beb498b60c8fefa86ac544b04.600x338.jpg?t=1764793555"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/54506d9e05c4a0ba3a6f149869edb5a136987c09/ss_54506d9e05c4a0ba3a6f149869edb5a136987c09.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/54506d9e05c4a0ba3a6f149869edb5a136987c09/ss_54506d9e05c4a0ba3a6f149869edb5a136987c09.600x338.jpg?t=1764793555"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/ba990123343bf33b5ae775c83ce3f1d1c43197d9/ss_ba990123343bf33b5ae775c83ce3f1d1c43197d9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/ba990123343bf33b5ae775c83ce3f1d1c43197d9/ss_ba990123343bf33b5ae775c83ce3f1d1c43197d9.600x338.jpg?t=1764793555"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/18d284f99e15ed1694f974c72fe44923a2a00f62/ss_18d284f99e15ed1694f974c72fe44923a2a00f62.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/18d284f99e15ed1694f974c72fe44923a2a00f62/ss_18d284f99e15ed1694f974c72fe44923a2a00f62.600x338.jpg?t=1764793555"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/aa10845326388570a98d0756c03dc964846878b1/ss_aa10845326388570a98d0756c03dc964846878b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/aa10845326388570a98d0756c03dc964846878b1/ss_aa10845326388570a98d0756c03dc964846878b1.600x338.jpg?t=1764793555"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/4161c434191fbb1e236fa4465b63841bd11d2da7/ss_4161c434191fbb1e236fa4465b63841bd11d2da7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/4161c434191fbb1e236fa4465b63841bd11d2da7/ss_4161c434191fbb1e236fa4465b63841bd11d2da7.600x338.jpg?t=1764793555"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688030/d9bc3626856943674352ffbb74d70ade9822f600/ss_d9bc3626856943674352ffbb74d70ade9822f600.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764793555","path_thumbnail":"htt